WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.933
Today we will share artworks with an audience. Our work connects with communities

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:05.661
across Africa.

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:09.285
Choose finished works and give each a title label.

00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:13.371
Place the works where viewers can see them without crowding.

00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:20.106
Guide visitors to observe one artwork and ask a respectful question. Explain one

00:00:20.106 --> 00:00:23.536
respectful similarity or difference with another African example.
